	"behavior": [
		"Atomic verified projection installation checks source, tenant, actor, process, trust, applied revision, freshness and shape. Failed, stale, conflicting and raced updates preserve restrictions; offline reads are detached and identity-scoped.",
		"Shared settings port feeds existing host write guards and pin restorers. Current policy permits unheld keys and holds denied keys; unavailable or invalid scope never grants writes.",
		"Approved options expose bounded opaque provider/model/account/workspace/tool/credential/permission/transport references, locks, revision and expiry. Renderer reads clear on failure/expiry; options do not authorize mutations or launches.",
		"Credential launch binding independently rechecks consumer, revision, provider, destination and account before lookup. Immutable references, expiry and inherited OAuth/config/env/argv ceilings preserve account isolation within the local launch planner.",
